{"uuid":"41044897-b70a-4e2b-8eb6-baf843a14a43","variant":"base","mode":"judged","viewport":"desktop,mobile","verdict":"pass","notes":"D21 sample (SHA-256 first byte 0x01); no new prompt kind, status indicator, or visual effect. Run by judged.mjs (run-scenario.mjs), desktop and mobile. Player, base: tapping Extractor of Souls opens the abandonCost chooseCards prompt (Cancel, 0/1 Submit) offering exactly the source and the staged Warrior, never the staged Survivor; a reload mid-prompt restores the same prompt id and committed state; abandoning the Warrior creates one 1-spark player warrior figment shown on the board inside the viewport. A second activation offers only the source (the figment and the Survivor are excluded), so the forced single candidate is auto-answered; the source goes to the void and a second 1-spark warrior figment enters. Amplified (played from the lab hand): one abandon creates two 1-spark warrior figments. Enemy: the scripted activation abandons its Warrior, keeps its Survivor, and creates one 1-spark enemy warrior figment; the battle log reads the abandon, the activation, the created figment, and its entry for both sides. Empty caps throughout.","bead":"hv-umm2.160","commit":"984dfa9fcb2e43b631c2dd65dff7249ece3c78e4","evidenceDir":"invocations/run-dy3KCs","screens":["extractor-base-first-prompt-desktop.png","extractor-base-first-prompt-mobile.png","extractor-base-one-figment-desktop.png","extractor-base-one-figment-mobile.png","extractor-base-second-resolved-desktop.png","extractor-base-second-resolved-mobile.png","extractor-base-log-desktop.png","extractor-base-log-mobile.png","extractor-amplified-prompt-desktop.png","extractor-amplified-prompt-mobile.png","extractor-amplified-two-figments-desktop.png","extractor-amplified-two-figments-mobile.png","extractor-enemy-board-desktop.png","extractor-enemy-board-mobile.png","extractor-enemy-log-desktop.png","extractor-enemy-log-mobile.png"],"rawReport":"invocations/run-dy3KCs/judged.result.json","raw